    "summary": "Errata rewriting the Norn Assimilator's **[[HARPOONED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/harpooned)** weapon ability. If, as the Norn Assimilator **declares a charge**, an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit hit this turn by an attack with this weapon is within 12″, you may use it:\n\n- the Norn Assimilator gets +2 on **[Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)** until the phase ends\n- its **[Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)** must finish **engaged** with that **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit",
